   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Hi all,<div><br></div><div>After I created a second tabPanel to display an HTML File, the dygraphs that I had outputting on the first tab no longer load.</div><div><br></div><div>After I added this tabPanel, my first Panel no longer output the dygraphs.</div><div><div style=\"border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word;background-color:rgb(250,250,250)\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">tabPanel</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Panel #2&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>           fluidRow</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>               includeHTML</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;www/basic.html&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>            <br>           </span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span></div></code></div><div><br></div></div><div><span style=\"font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;background-color:white\">Does anyone know why implementing <i>includeHTML </i>made my graphs stop displaying?</span><br></div><div><br></div></div>"
    ]
   ]
  },
